      "id": 64503,
      "name": "JimmytheRat",
      "username": "JimmytheRat",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/j/c37758/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2013-05-28T04:24:56.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>On a related order-of-operations note, how do Pipe Wrench and Driving Mantis interact?&nbsp; Is the damage reduction applied before or after the condition check for redirection, or is it based on play order?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>As a follow-up, if it's NOT dependent on play order, then why is the Superhuman Durability-Fortitude interaction dependent on play order?</p>",
