      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/d/f05b48/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2013-05-28T04:54:11.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>It plays like this:</p><p>Fixer gets hit for 3 damage. PW reduces it to 2. Mantis redirects it, it goes back to 3. Boom.</p>",
