    {
      "id": 64505,
      "name": "Ronway",
      "username": "Ronway",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ronway/{size}/1856_2.png",
      "created_at": "2013-05-28T05:13:56.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>The ruling for Superhuman Durability and Fortitude is quite old, in fact they may change their mind at this point because of the Wrench and Mantis. If you were to play it similar to that however Fortitude would always reduce damage first than SHD would trigger if the damage is still above 5.</p>",
